Conceptual attribution
----------------------
ERM adapts the design-and-review pattern of the Elephant-Goldfish Model (EGM),
published by Google under the Apache License 2.0:
  https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model
ERM is an independent project. It contains no code copied from EGM, and it is
not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Google.

The research-specific rubrics are the author's own formulation, informed by:
  Feng, B. et al. Agentic AI systems for scientific discovery.
  Nature Reviews Methods Primers 6, 81 (2026). doi:10.1038/s43586-026-00534-y
  Lu, C. et al. Towards end-to-end automation of AI research.
  Nature 651 (2026). doi:10.1038/s41586-026-10265-5
No text, figures or tables from these publications are reproduced here.
